WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:05.560
The Principality of Pastillage

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:04.160
The opening of the joint event

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:06.190
between the three countries 
is drawing closer.

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:07.650
For those discussions,

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:11.740
the princess from Biscotti 
and Leo-sama from Galette,

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:14.770
are making their way toward Pastillage.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.950
Castle Eschenbach

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:20.830
Of course, the heroes are all 
accompanying their lieges...

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:25.000
So today, the three of us will 
be reunited in the castle.

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:06.560
Pastillage's Hero King Legend

00:02:06.910 --> 00:02:10.440
All right, let's begin 
the final discussions.

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:14.410
Then let's decide on the pending issues.

00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:18.360
I have to say, ladies,
you are looking especially...

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:24.800
...fine today.

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:26.120
So are you, Cou-sama!

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:29.830
Your tail is looking 
especially luxurious.

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:33.810
That's because Rebecca is brushing

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:36.410
it so gently all the time.

00:02:36.410 --> 00:02:40.680
That's how my hair and my 
tail have become so fluffy.

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:41.780
Wow!

00:02:41.780 --> 00:02:43.380
I see.

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:44.760
Truth be told,

00:02:45.270 --> 00:02:49.220
Nanami has been treating me 
to Earth-style oil massages.

00:02:49.220 --> 00:02:52.490
It makes my skin resplendent!

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:58.030
This morning, Sink played 
with me at the lake...

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:00.530
and, after that, he even braided my hair!

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:02.070
Ah hah!

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:05.120
That hair-style does look very cute!

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:08.140
I even put in my favorite ribbon.

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:11.280
Hmm, it looks like the leaders 
of the three countries

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:12.790
have worthy Heroes looking after them.

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:13.970
That's right.

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:15.590
I'm so happy.

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:16.840
You can say that again.

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:22.580
Leo-sama is so cute.

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:24.590
I'm so happy!

00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:27.250
My Cou-sama is really cute, too.

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:28.670
She's so healthy and happy

00:03:28.670 --> 00:03:30.130
and she loves to be spoiled.

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:33.090
Loving your ruler deeply

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:35.770
is a cornerstone of herodom, young ones.

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:37.690
Sounds like someone's 
talking down to us.

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:40.860
As if you weren't totally smitten 
with the Princess yourself.

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:43.920
I am a Hero, after all.

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:46.030
What's with the gentleman act?

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:49.020
That reminds me.

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:50.620
How is Isuka-san doing?

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:52.670
He's doing fine.

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:54.480
Right now, he's at Fuugetsu Lodge.

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:01.890
He's going to build a
 workshop in the area

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:04.030
and stay there for a while.

00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:06.550
Lady d'Arquien and Yuki were 
quite happy about that.

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:08.310
That's good.

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:13.060
Oh, do we really not 
have any work to do?

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:15.060
That's what I heard.

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:21.220
Oh, but Sink, will you come talk 
to Cou-sama a little later?

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:22.570
Just me?

00:04:24.540 --> 00:04:25.450
Come in.

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:28.620
Oh, Hero Sink!

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:32.120
Is the meeting already over?

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.870
Yes, it went very smoothly.

00:04:35.590 --> 00:04:37.880
Right now, Millihi-nee and Leo-nee

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:39.630
are in the hall with the press.

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:41.230
What are Rebecca and Nanami up to?

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:43.170
They said they were going to take a bath,

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:44.930
in the palace's great bath.

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:47.140
Then that's perfect!

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:49.640
There's a place I'd like to take you.

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:01.570
Look!

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:03.010
There it is.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:14.260
This is the "Hill of the Hero King"

00:05:14.260 --> 00:05:15.580
Hero King?

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:18.640
The founding father of Pastillage.

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:20.840
My ancestor.

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:23.560
A long time ago, demons 
appeared in this land

00:05:23.560 --> 00:05:25.590
and endangered the peoples' lives.

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:29.860
The ruling lord used the 
hero summoning technique.

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:34.290
The Hero who came defeated 
demon after demon,

00:05:34.290 --> 00:05:37.800
until he finally defeated 
the king of the demons

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:40.310
and thus brought peace 
back to these lands.

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:42.580
Unfortunately, the ruling lord

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:45.860
lost his life in battle,

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:50.620
but his will bestowed the crown
 on the head of the Hero.

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:53.340
They called him the "White Hero King"

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:56.390
and he brought hope back to the people.

00:05:56.390 --> 00:05:58.120
So this place is...

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.300
That's right.

00:05:59.300 --> 00:06:01.590
This is the resting 
place of the Hero King.

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:03.640
It is also the place

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:05.880
where they sealed
 in the demon king.

00:06:06.540 --> 00:06:08.380
Even while he sleeps,

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:10.590
the Hero King makes certain 
that the demon king

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:11.890
stays sealed.

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:15.120
Another legend claims

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:18.400
that a miracle will happen 
when the descendant

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:22.010
of the Hero King touches this monolith.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:25.990
Just watch and see what 
happens when I touch it.

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:34.980
It reacts like this, but that's it.

00:06:34.980 --> 00:06:38.950
I made Nanami and Rebecca 
touch it earlier, too,

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:40.580
but nothing happened.

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:43.310
I thought maybe you could try it.

00:06:43.310 --> 00:06:44.430
Okay.

00:06:44.430 --> 00:06:45.420
I'll try.

00:06:50.490 --> 00:06:52.930
Maybe if I do it with you.

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:04.100
It's resonating.

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:06.030
Will a miracle happen?

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:08.110
Descendants recognized.

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:10.570
Unlocking the seal.

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:38.770
Damn it. I was enjoying my sleep.

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:42.490
Was it you?

00:07:42.490 --> 00:07:44.380
You woke me?

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:46.570
What happened?

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:47.740
I can't see a thing!

00:07:47.740 --> 00:07:49.650
Um... well....

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:55.160
Where is Adel?

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:58.060
Well... uhh...

00:07:58.060 --> 00:08:01.320
Waking up without Adel

00:08:01.320 --> 00:08:03.710
is a once in a lifetime opportunity!

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:04.710
What?

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:27.170
All right.

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:29.460
Hey, you kids.

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:31.440
Come here.

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:34.450
And you are?

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:36.950
My name is...

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:39.550
My name is...

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:41.200
Valeria Calvados!

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:47.000
But I guess you humans 
call me the Demon King.

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:48.250
The Demon King?

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:53.120
You kids...

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:56.150
For this brief freedom of mine...

00:08:58.010 --> 00:09:02.350
you shall forfeit your lives!

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:27.850
Kids nowadays have a 
lot of bright power.

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:29.040
Now...

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:32.300
I'm full, so let's get to it!

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:46.190
Not bad, not bad at all!

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:48.990
This way, baby.

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:54.010
They saw me.

00:09:55.560 --> 00:09:58.270
Someone's peeping!
 Outside the window!

00:09:58.270 --> 00:09:59.840
Peeping is a crime!

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:01.550
Aim!

00:10:23.900 --> 00:10:25.890
What a sight to behold!

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:28.310
And on we go.

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:33.820
Rise, storm!

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:40.570
The view is superb!

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:45.810
I don't know why the 
Demon King rose again,

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:48.580
but I'm sure he's headed for Pastillage.

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:51.880
We can't let the others 
fall into danger.

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:53.230
That's right!

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:54.880
Full speed ahead!

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:00.380
Look!

00:11:00.690 --> 00:11:02.300
Somebody's up there!

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:15.770
Don't panic, my girls, 
just show me your skin!

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:18.400
Ex Machina!

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:22.030
Form Boomerang! Slash!

00:11:23.830 --> 00:11:24.870
Are you even trying?

00:11:29.110 --> 00:11:32.550
Palette Set Shoot!

00:11:40.370 --> 00:11:41.260
Neptune!

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:45.300
Boiling Water! Fist!

00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:49.780
Being a pervert...

00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:51.980
...is a serious crime indeed!

00:11:57.330 --> 00:11:59.660
The weather is so beautiful.

00:12:00.590 --> 00:12:02.130
It sure is.

00:12:04.210 --> 00:12:05.100
What the...

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:09.470
For my first bath in ages,

00:12:09.470 --> 00:12:11.000
that was a little on the lukewarm side.

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:13.070
What is that?

00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:15.250
He looks hurt.

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:20.090
There you are!

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:28.220
Are you two okay?!

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:30.050
Yes.

00:12:30.050 --> 00:12:32.850
Your Excellency! Princess Millihiore!

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:35.540
We've got an intruder!

00:12:36.840 --> 00:12:38.980
Oww. Hot, hot!

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:42.030
You there!

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:45.280
You are arrested on charges 
of lewd behavior and peeping!

00:12:45.620 --> 00:12:46.420
Huh?

00:12:46.420 --> 00:12:47.160
Peeping?

00:12:47.590 --> 00:12:49.650
Who are you calling lewd?

00:12:49.650 --> 00:12:52.180
Listen to me, humans!

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:57.670
This is...

00:12:58.070 --> 00:13:01.050
I am Calvados, the Demon King.

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:07.550
Fear me. Worship me.

00:13:09.670 --> 00:13:11.310
Millihi, are you all right?

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:12.890
Yes!

00:13:19.050 --> 00:13:22.110
<i>This is the ribbon Rico 
gave me last year.</i>

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:23.900
<i>It's my favorite.</i>

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:25.360
<i>Really?</i>

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:31.780
Can you feel the fear 
rock your very core?

00:13:31.780 --> 00:13:34.960
Are you prepared to grovel 
and beg for forgiveness?

00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:38.410
Excuse me, Cou-sama.

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:39.960
I'm going to leave your side for a bit.

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:43.380
I am the Demon King!

00:13:47.190 --> 00:13:49.760
I don't care if you're the 
Demon King or whatever,

00:13:50.160 --> 00:13:51.490
but there is nothing 
worse than a man who...

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:52.930
threatens girls, causes grief,

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:55.060
and then has the gall to laugh about it!

00:13:56.960 --> 00:13:58.990
You will apologize to the 
princess, to Cou-sama,

00:13:58.990 --> 00:14:02.270
to everyone you have terrorized!

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:03.900
Sink...

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:05.860
Is everyone okay?

00:14:10.360 --> 00:14:11.870
You little...

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:14.220
Don't underestimate me!

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:24.370
You, Demon King.

00:14:24.370 --> 00:14:27.050
It would be for your own 
good if you just apologized.

00:14:28.190 --> 00:14:31.920
It looks like you all really 
want to piss me off.

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:34.560
Demon King Seal!

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:36.560
Everybody, run!

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:39.060
Dark Circle of Absorption!

00:14:41.050 --> 00:14:43.070
I can't move!

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:46.610
My power is draining away.

00:14:52.650 --> 00:14:54.120
Thank you kindly.

00:14:57.980 --> 00:14:59.220
Did you see?

00:14:59.220 --> 00:15:00.730
This is the strength of the 
Demon King's power,

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:02.750
the power that once ruled this world!

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:07.380
A bright power drain spell, huh?

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:10.380
What I'd expect from a demon king.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:13.010
Still, we won't be defeated!

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:15.760
You might be a demon king,

00:15:15.770 --> 00:15:19.400
but I am the descendant of the Hero King!

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:22.150
I will protect my country, 
I will protect my guests!

00:15:22.510 --> 00:15:24.520
Just you watch!

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:29.480
The Hero King is not here.

00:15:29.480 --> 00:15:31.770
Nobody is here to save you.

00:15:31.770 --> 00:15:32.910
Except for us!

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:33.990
What?

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:40.050
For the countries and 
the masters we love...

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:41.000
Rebecca!

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:43.850
We will always come in an instant!

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:44.750
Nanami!

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:00.890
We three Heroes are right here!

00:16:01.240 --> 00:16:02.600
Sink!

00:16:06.390 --> 00:16:08.410
Just as expected, he's tough...

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:10.340
He <i>is</i> the Demon King.

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:12.340
How do we seal him?

00:16:12.340 --> 00:16:14.120
They say the Hero King

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:16.780
was able to seal him in back then.

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:18.790
"A heart that won't give up"

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:21.420
and "a summoning voice" confirmed.

00:16:24.730 --> 00:16:25.590
What is this?

00:16:25.590 --> 00:16:28.420
All summoning conditions fulfilled.

00:16:28.780 --> 00:16:31.510
Summoning Adelaide, the Hero King.

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:35.220
I don't believe this!

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.480
I can't see a thing!

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:45.310
My heart of courage is fully charged.

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:53.820
Your emotions are my strength!

00:16:55.290 --> 00:17:00.120
I will always respond to a 
call for justice and hope.

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:01.660
I am...

00:17:02.780 --> 00:17:04.650
Adelaide Grand Marnier!

00:17:05.380 --> 00:17:07.040
The Hero King!

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:08.630
All right?

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:11.380
The Hero King?

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:12.670
Adel?

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:14.240
Valerie?

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:16.430
Or should I say, Demon King Calvados?

00:17:17.060 --> 00:17:19.300
Your evil deeds stop here.

00:17:19.590 --> 00:17:21.420
Now just a minute, Adel.

00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:22.780
Why am I accused of evil deeds

00:17:22.780 --> 00:17:24.560
when they started this fight?

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:29.230
Be quiet!

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:31.210
You have disturbed these peaceful people

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:34.180
and what's more, you sexually 
harassed all these girls

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:35.850
without caring or knowing
 who they were!

00:17:35.850 --> 00:17:37.110
But that's...

00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:40.160
Your excuses are futile.

00:17:40.440 --> 00:17:41.790
Prepare for divine retribution!

00:17:44.840 --> 00:17:47.110
Wait Adel, if you do 
that, I'll die.

00:17:47.110 --> 00:17:49.040
It really will kill me, no joke...

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.380
Repent in the light!

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:53.460
No, no, no, no, no!

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:02.260
Grand Marnier Hammer!

00:18:13.510 --> 00:18:14.370
Huh?

00:18:18.050 --> 00:18:22.410
So this monolith was the summoning 
point for the Hero King?

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:23.740
That's right.

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:25.810
I had it erected so that 
I could be summoned,

00:18:25.810 --> 00:18:28.700
should the power of the 
Hero King be necessary

00:18:28.700 --> 00:18:30.290
in an hour of need.

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:35.800
I am gathering miracle 
power while I sleep here.

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:37.210
Valerie.

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:40.830
Did you apologize to all these 
people you inconvenienced?

00:18:40.830 --> 00:18:43.810
Yeah, yeah. I did.

00:18:47.110 --> 00:18:49.680
Once again, I am so deeply sorry!

00:18:49.680 --> 00:18:50.730
I won't do it again!

00:18:51.420 --> 00:18:53.540
It seems he is repenting 
his wicked ways.

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:55.820
Please find it in your 
heart to forgive him.

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:57.350
Um...

00:18:57.350 --> 00:19:00.070
Well, as long as he doesn't do it again.

00:19:00.690 --> 00:19:04.640
Then the two of us will 
return to our slumber.

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:05.960
That means you, too.

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:10.040
Damn, I wanted to have some more fun.

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:15.460
Hero Sleep Routine, restarted.

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:19.540
Couverte, couldn't we keep the Hero King

00:19:19.540 --> 00:19:22.590
and that Demon King a little longer?

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:25.760
It would be nice if the 
Hero King could stay a bit

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:29.480
and see our current 
world after all this...

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:33.470
It looks like the Demon King 
isn't so evil after all.

00:19:33.470 --> 00:19:34.510
And then...

00:19:34.510 --> 00:19:35.480
More than anything...

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:41.670
After everything, 
you're still the cutest...

00:19:42.260 --> 00:19:43.920
Which of your tongues is speaking?

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:44.870
Which?!

00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:47.760
I really want to know what kind of

00:19:47.760 --> 00:19:49.620
relationship those two have.

00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:54.160
You two don't have to be in 
such a hurry to get back.

00:19:54.160 --> 00:19:56.270
We're too old to stay long

00:19:56.270 --> 00:19:59.180
in the country of young people.

00:19:59.180 --> 00:20:01.630
This old man and old 
lady are signing out.

00:20:01.990 --> 00:20:04.720
It made me really happy to see

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:06.800
my cute descendants and princesses,

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:10.140
as well as the new crop of 
healthy, young Heroes...

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:14.700
Okay, farewell.

00:20:17.390 --> 00:20:18.440
Huh?

00:20:18.930 --> 00:20:23.540
Problem identified in Hero Sleep 
Routine's magic circuitry.

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:29.340
Repairi- repai- re- re- re

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:32.290
Did it... break?

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:36.290
Looks like it.

00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:37.780
What?

00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:40.350
Well, looky here.

00:20:40.350 --> 00:20:42.880
Now what do we do?

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:47.070
So, how is it?

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:50.870
Apparently the wear and tear

00:20:50.870 --> 00:20:52.890
of the many years have left their mark.

00:20:53.570 --> 00:20:56.680
I heard that the repairs will 
take quite a long time.

00:20:56.680 --> 00:20:58.480
What about those two?

00:20:58.480 --> 00:21:01.990
They'll be staying in 
Pastillage for a while.

00:21:03.590 --> 00:21:07.370
Even the Demon King agreed 
to be on his best behavior.

00:21:08.250 --> 00:21:11.540
I'm so glad I was able 
to meet my ancestor.

00:21:11.920 --> 00:21:14.560
It's good that she's such a nice person.

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:15.370
Yeah.

00:21:15.720 --> 00:21:19.610
I have to thank Sink later.

00:21:19.610 --> 00:21:23.070
He was pretty cool today.

00:21:23.070 --> 00:21:24.880
Maybe just a little.

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:33.490
Sink, you really are my Hero!

00:21:33.490 --> 00:21:34.640
I love you!

00:21:34.860 --> 00:21:37.390
Th-Thank you, Princess.

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:44.760
<i>I wonder why the princess is so happy.</i>

00:21:45.230 --> 00:21:48.030
<i>I'm glad, but I don't get the reason.</i>

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:52.380
<i>Oh well, whatever. She's cute.</i>

00:21:52.380 --> 00:21:55.040
There, there.

00:23:30.900 --> 00:23:33.270
I am the Demon King!

00:23:33.960 --> 00:23:35.040
I can't see anything!

00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:36.560
Cou-sama, you mustn't look!

00:23:35.180 --> 00:23:45.000
<b>Battle at the Cave of Sealing!</b>

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:38.660
Let's fully charge our hearts 
with courage again, next time!

00:23:38.660 --> 00:23:39.690
Okay?
